= Results

The ten synthetic runs yield a mean settling time of 12.8 s and a mean absolute steady-state error of 0.42 C. Table @tab-results summarizes selected runs. The small variation was deliberately generated and must not be interpreted as experimental uncertainty.

#figure(
  table(
    columns: 4,
    inset: 4pt,
    align: center,
    [*Run*], [*Settling time (s)*], [*Error (C)*], [*Peak command*],
    [1], [12.5], [0.40], [1.00],
    [5], [13.0], [0.45], [1.00],
    [10], [12.7], [0.40], [1.00],
  ),
  caption: [Selected synthetic demonstration results.],
) <tab-results>

The full synthetic table is stored in `data/summary.csv`.
